/T (Joe E.)
/Contents (In order to find signatures of LiH at the redshifts accessible at the CARMA observatory \(z=0.64-1.1, z=2.85-4.2\), Friedel et al. \(2011\) adopted the strategy of looking towards Einstein Rings \(that is, gravitationally-lensed quasars\), seeking out the absorption seen in the molecular clouds within the lensing galaxy.)
