/T (Joe E.)
/Contents (Friedel et al. \(2011\) was mostly unsuccessful in detecting LiH signatures - their only success was in detecting the ^7LiH line \(with 3-sigma confidence\) towards the object B0218+357. They searched for the ^6LiH J = 0-1 transition in vain. Hence, this analysis was ultimately not enough to draw any major conclusions, i.e. validate a given model for BBN. It was concluded that LiH held promise for detection of extragalactic Li, but further future investigations were required to hone estimates of primordial Li abundance.)
/CreationDate (D:20250129125135-08'00')
/M (D:20250129125135-08'00')
